WEBVTT

01:30.380 --> 01:32.200
Die, you bastard!

01:41.870 --> 01:45.840
EPISODE 2: THOSE WHO SEEK TO OWN RELICS

01:44.880 --> 01:46.630
B-Boss!

01:45.570 --> 01:46.630
Boss!

01:49.670 --> 01:51.540
I'll be taking this.

01:51.960 --> 01:53.830
No! My knife!

01:55.020 --> 01:56.360
Let me show you...

01:57.470 --> 01:59.060
how you properly use it.

02:06.570 --> 02:07.570
Hey!

02:27.000 --> 02:29.620
This freak actually stabbed me!

02:29.930 --> 02:32.120
Well? Want to keep going?

02:40.430 --> 02:42.430
XIANG GALLERY

02:40.430 --> 02:42.430
What did you just say?!

02:42.720 --> 02:44.900
Ryoga, of all people, beat you up?

02:44.900 --> 02:45.940
And?

02:45.940 --> 02:49.440
You expect me to believe that?

02:49.930 --> 02:53.850
He suddenly started moving crazy fast!

02:53.850 --> 02:55.650
Like a totally different person!

02:55.650 --> 02:57.730
<i>Even his eyes changed colors!</i>

02:57.730 --> 03:00.150
How much did he take from you?

03:00.470 --> 03:04.160
Well... all the money in my account...

03:04.160 --> 03:05.420
<i>and the Buddha statue.</i>

03:05.420 --> 03:06.820
What?!

03:06.820 --> 03:09.090
You useless little shit!

03:09.090 --> 03:11.800
Go get it back right now!

03:16.090 --> 03:18.800
Hm, strange.

03:18.800 --> 03:23.030
That ain't even worth 5,000 yen.
Any broker would tell you the same.

03:23.030 --> 03:24.520
Might as well get rid of it.

03:26.790 --> 03:31.630
It can't just be junk if Arai 
was panicking like that over it.

03:33.030 --> 03:36.530
SPY SKILL UNLOCKED
THE STATUE CONTAINS A SUSPICIOUS SUBSTANCE

03:34.480 --> 03:36.530
A suspicious substance?

03:36.860 --> 03:38.190
<i>Inside it?</i>

03:43.710 --> 03:45.400
Oh, I get it.

03:59.100 --> 04:00.710
Thought so.

04:02.220 --> 04:04.970
<i>That's nothing you'd 
hand over to a pawn shop.</i>

04:06.900 --> 04:07.760
<i>Hey, Ryoga?</i>

04:07.760 --> 04:09.470
Hi, Ken-san.

04:09.470 --> 04:13.390
XIANG GALLERY

04:12.210 --> 04:15.170
Ah... Yes, sir... The thing is, sir...

04:15.170 --> 04:19.030
Of course. I am terribly sorry. Yes, sir.

04:19.760 --> 04:21.530
Who is it? I'm on the phone!

04:23.020 --> 04:24.860
S-Sis...

04:24.860 --> 04:28.040
We received a tip about 
several drug offenses.

04:28.040 --> 04:32.170
D-Drugs? All we sell is art.

04:32.170 --> 04:34.040
We're law-abiding citizens.

04:36.320 --> 04:41.050
We already collected the evidence.
I assume the rest is in the warehouse?

04:41.460 --> 04:45.230
<i>How do they know about 
the warehouse in Chiba?</i>

04:45.230 --> 04:48.980
<i>Good thing every room
is password-protected.</i>

04:50.290 --> 04:52.610
A warehouse? And what evidence?

04:52.610 --> 04:54.340
Or can cops just do whatever they want?

04:54.340 --> 04:56.610
<i>All the art pieces have been checked.</i>

04:57.610 --> 05:00.090
<i>We found drugs in all of them.</i>

05:01.240 --> 05:05.370
Y-You... opened all the rooms?!

05:06.250 --> 05:07.480
Nice and quiet now.

05:07.480 --> 05:11.390
But that's impossible! Every room 
had a different password!

05:11.390 --> 05:13.880
Whoa, there. Hold up a sec.

05:14.640 --> 05:15.920
For you.

05:16.550 --> 05:20.540
<i>Maybe you should've lived 
a little more decently.</i>

05:19.500 --> 05:22.050
N-No... Goriki?!

05:22.370 --> 05:27.000
You should change your passwords 
periodically, even if it's a hassle.

05:27.000 --> 05:30.060
Well, enjoy prison.

05:31.060 --> 05:34.420
Damn you, Goriki Ryoga!

05:34.420 --> 05:36.320
I'll get you for this!

05:44.870 --> 05:51.870
KEN-SAN

05:44.870 --> 05:51.870
YOU'LL GET YOUR
TEN MILLION YEN REWARD SOON.

05:44.870 --> 05:51.870
DON'T BLOW IT ALL. SAVE UP.

05:44.870 --> 05:47.020
<i>You'll get your ten 
million yen reward soon.</i>

05:47.020 --> 05:49.440
<i>Don't blow it all. Save up.</i>

05:49.440 --> 05:51.870
He worries way too much.

05:52.220 --> 05:54.750
That takes care of my starting capital.

05:54.750 --> 05:56.790
Guess I'll go home and sleep.

05:56.790 --> 06:00.590
Tomorrow, the tomb hunt begins.

06:06.710 --> 06:09.070
<i>I thought my apartment was here...</i>

06:09.760 --> 06:12.140
<i>Wait... Did a tomb appear here?</i>

06:14.480 --> 06:17.460
<i>Is this good or bad luck?</i>

06:23.930 --> 06:25.690
Yeah, it's unbelievable.

06:25.690 --> 06:26.680
What's going on?

06:26.680 --> 06:27.740
Are you all right?

06:27.740 --> 06:28.700
I'm fine.

06:28.700 --> 06:30.660
Yes, I just arrived.

06:30.970 --> 06:32.570
<i>Good. Get started.</i>

06:33.930 --> 06:37.280
The government doesn't know
about the tombs yet, correct?

06:37.980 --> 06:40.110
We'll be detonating this one soon.

06:40.110 --> 06:43.670
So far, no one seems to have 
recognized it as a tomb.

06:44.090 --> 06:45.150
Goodbye.

06:46.100 --> 06:47.180
Hello there.

06:47.540 --> 06:48.750
You?

06:50.040 --> 06:53.390
Why so surprised, Linda Walker?

06:53.980 --> 06:57.160
What's an excavation team from 
the Republic of Bent doing here?

06:57.160 --> 07:01.190
I don't need someone from the 
United States asking me that.

07:01.560 --> 07:03.240
How's the jet lag?

07:03.560 --> 07:07.240
You're awfully enthusiastic 
about being a thief, Rui Kenshi.

07:07.520 --> 07:11.220
Come on, we both know what 
we're after. Why the hypocrisy?

07:11.220 --> 07:14.500
Better stay on your toes, 
or that relic is ours.

07:14.500 --> 07:16.070
<i>What's this?</i>

07:16.070 --> 07:18.220
<i>The cunning CIA</i>

07:18.220 --> 07:22.840
<i>and the morons of the Republic of Bent's 
excavation team are already here?</i>

07:23.390 --> 07:27.620
<i>But seriously, explosives? These guys 
don't know how to handle tombs.</i>

07:27.620 --> 07:31.010
<i>I guess there are no experts
around, then. Good.</i>

07:33.910 --> 07:35.360
Aren't these...

07:38.020 --> 07:40.270
<i>Yeah, they're definitely tomb glyphs.</i>

07:42.020 --> 07:44.980
<i>Tomb glyphs are the 
language of the relics.</i>

07:45.920 --> 07:50.930
<i>And they're going into great detail
writing about themselves.</i>

07:52.780 --> 07:58.560
<i>If you can read the glyphs, you'll find
out where the entrance and traps are.</i>

08:01.130 --> 08:03.880
This is going great already.

08:06.620 --> 08:08.940
<i>Let's start reading, then.</i>

08:10.890 --> 08:12.930
[EXPERT CRYPTOGRAPHER]
YOU HAVE GAINED A NEW TITLE AND UNLOCKED A SKILL

08:12.930 --> 08:15.390
TOMB RAIDER BASIC SKILLS
LINGUISTICS (RANK F) HAS BEEN UNLOCKED

08:13.650 --> 08:16.730
Well, how nice of that damn crow.

08:15.390 --> 08:17.390
TOMB RAIDER BASIC SKILLS (2/4)

08:15.390 --> 08:17.390
SPY [RANK F]
DETECT EVERYTHING IN A 1-METER RADIUS

08:15.390 --> 08:17.390
LINGUISTICS [RANK F]
IMPROVED UNDERSTANDING IN ALL LANGUAGES

08:18.260 --> 08:22.610
Perfect. I just need to unlock two more.

08:25.620 --> 08:27.250
This must be it.

08:30.910 --> 08:32.910
All right, let's go in.

08:54.110 --> 08:55.220
Wh-What is that?

08:57.420 --> 08:59.450
The tomb entrance seems to be opening!

08:59.450 --> 09:02.260
What do you mean, it's "opening"?

09:09.490 --> 09:11.950
What a spectacle!

09:13.060 --> 09:15.200
What the hell is going on?

09:25.870 --> 09:29.200
<i>Something should be 
turning up pretty soon.</i>

09:34.950 --> 09:36.110
Here we go.

09:37.360 --> 09:39.330
<i>This is definitely the place.</i>

09:48.550 --> 09:49.820
Found it.

10:04.180 --> 10:06.210
This should do it, I think.

10:15.140 --> 10:17.560
Looks like I have a visitor.

10:27.760 --> 10:34.020
What poor soul has dropped 
his treasure in my pond this time?

10:34.020 --> 10:36.240
Hey, over here!

10:37.090 --> 10:38.600
Can't you see me?

10:40.250 --> 10:42.520
How careless.

10:46.200 --> 10:47.710
Now, then...

10:48.230 --> 10:52.760
The gold knife or the silver knife—
which one is yours?

10:53.690 --> 10:57.010
<i>This relic is the Gold/Silver Axe."</i>

10:57.700 --> 11:02.660
<i>
It's a very famous story based on 
"Hermes and The Woodcutter"</i>

11:02.660 --> 11:05.580
<i>with variations found all over the world.</i>

11:05.580 --> 11:09.260
<i>Anyone from anywhere 
could clear this tomb easily.</i>

11:09.260 --> 11:12.150
<i>But this time, it'll be me.</i>

11:12.920 --> 11:15.400
Now, make your choice.

11:15.830 --> 11:19.410
Unfortunately, neither one is mine.

11:22.290 --> 11:24.650
You are an honest one.

11:24.650 --> 11:28.590
Then perhaps this one belongs to you?

11:31.820 --> 11:33.790
<i>It's following the story exactly.</i>

11:33.790 --> 11:39.540
<i>If I say yes, I get my knife,
a gold one, and a silver one.</i>

11:39.540 --> 11:41.890
<i>That would clear the tomb. But...</i>

11:42.280 --> 11:45.890
May I take a closer look to make sure?

11:47.200 --> 11:49.100
Be my guest.

11:56.690 --> 11:59.910
What do you think you're doing?!

12:00.530 --> 12:02.910
Shut up. I don't trust you things.

12:04.190 --> 12:08.420
There's no guarantee you'll 
reward me for passing your trial.

12:08.920 --> 12:11.400
And even if you do,

12:11.400 --> 12:13.920
it could turn me into a deranged murderer.

12:14.340 --> 12:17.920
H-How do you know about that?

12:18.270 --> 12:20.340
<i>I think it happened in the US.</i>

12:20.340 --> 12:26.850
SERIAL KILLINGS IN THE STATES

12:20.340 --> 12:26.850
RELIC USER CAUSES YET ANOTHER TRAGEDY

12:20.650 --> 12:22.780
<i>At the time, the Gold/Silver Axe</i>

12:22.780 --> 12:26.850
<i>turned its user into a serial killer.</i>

12:32.670 --> 12:34.280
Bring it on!

12:34.280 --> 12:35.860
The relic is mine!

12:41.880 --> 12:43.870
Just admit defeat already!

12:45.810 --> 12:50.620
Do you think you can claim me this way?!

12:50.620 --> 12:52.890
Let's see how long you can hold out.

12:52.890 --> 12:55.050
I'll use dominance to subdue you!

13:06.310 --> 13:10.690
<i>Affinity: The ability to 
control relics through trust.</i>

13:11.270 --> 13:16.690
<i>Dominance: the ability to coerce 
and force a relic to obey.</i>

13:17.260 --> 13:21.390
<i>Compatibility: the ideal bond 
between relic and master.</i>

13:21.390 --> 13:24.730
<i>Like a musician with an instrument relic.</i>

13:40.120 --> 13:42.730
<i>Damn, this thing's stubborn!</i>

13:48.310 --> 13:50.390
Get off! Get off of me!

13:51.660 --> 13:54.370
I'll never do as you relics say!

13:54.370 --> 13:58.570
I won't be bothering with 
affinity this time around!

13:58.900 --> 14:00.660
Obey me, relic!

14:00.660 --> 14:04.990
If you won't admit defeat,
I'll destroy you.

14:04.990 --> 14:06.490
Do you think I can't?!

14:07.090 --> 14:10.110
Didn't you hear me?! I said stop!

14:31.860 --> 14:33.590
<i>What a pain in the ass.</i>

14:33.590 --> 14:35.510
<i>You should've obeyed from the start.</i>

14:43.730 --> 14:45.530
Gorgeous, ain't it?

14:45.530 --> 14:47.280
[TOMB SURVIVOR]
YOU HAVE GAINED A NEW TITLE AND UNLOCKED A SKILL

14:47.280 --> 14:48.910
TOMB RAIDER BASIC SKILLS
TOMB EXCAVATION [RANK F] HAS BEEN UNLOCKED

14:48.910 --> 14:51.540
TOMB RAIDER BASIC SKILLS (3/4)

14:48.910 --> 14:51.540
SPY [RANK F]
DETECT EVERYTHING IN A 1-METER RADIUS

14:48.910 --> 14:51.540
LINGUISTICS [RANK F]
IMPROVED UNDERSTANDING IN ALL LANGUAGES

14:48.910 --> 14:51.540
TOMB EXCAVATION [RANK F]
INCREASED UNDERSTANDING OF TOMBS

14:51.540 --> 14:53.840
Oh, a new tomb raider skill.

14:53.840 --> 14:58.570
I just need to unlock one more.
So how do I do it?

15:02.550 --> 15:05.550
[ABUSER OF RELICS]

15:02.550 --> 15:05.550
YOU HAVE ACQUIRED A NEW TITLE.
YOUR DOMINANCE HAS INCREASED.

15:02.550 --> 15:05.550
YOUR AFFINITY HAS DECREASED.

15:02.910 --> 15:05.550
"Abuser of Relics"?

15:05.550 --> 15:08.060
What? "Abuser"?!

15:08.400 --> 15:10.790
You damn crow.

15:10.790 --> 15:13.490
You're trying to mess with me, aren't you?

15:13.490 --> 15:14.850
Right, this is it.

15:15.460 --> 15:17.350
There! The pond!

15:19.510 --> 15:21.490
Just as the prophecy foretold.

15:23.080 --> 15:25.830
Come on out, relic.

15:27.160 --> 15:29.160
Wh-What are you doing?

15:29.620 --> 15:32.550
You idiots are too late.

15:36.320 --> 15:38.170
Why is nothing happening?

15:38.670 --> 15:43.020
The prophet said all I needed to do
was throw a relic in the pond!

15:43.020 --> 15:44.170
A prophet?

15:44.700 --> 15:48.180
So the Republic of Bent really 
does have a prophecy relic.

15:48.180 --> 15:52.370
N-No! Stop trying to get intel from me!

15:53.120 --> 15:54.430
What's going on now?

15:55.210 --> 15:56.760
A-An earthquake.

16:01.940 --> 16:03.940
Shit! We're in real trouble now!

16:06.500 --> 16:07.950
We have to get out!

16:13.990 --> 16:17.960
XIANG GALLERY

16:16.530 --> 16:17.960
What the hell?

16:18.370 --> 16:21.460
They really took everything.
There's nothing left!

16:21.800 --> 16:26.400
With our boss arrested,
this business is finished...

16:26.400 --> 16:28.070
I know that!

16:28.070 --> 16:32.470
And it's all Ryoga's fault. 
I oughta kill him!

16:32.470 --> 16:34.600
I won't take this lying down!

16:34.970 --> 16:39.850
Yeah, that's more like it!
Are you gonna kick his ass?

16:39.850 --> 16:43.110
Duh! I'm the great 
Kureha Noboru, remember?

16:43.110 --> 16:46.440
A man always keeps his word,
and I am a man among men!

16:46.440 --> 16:48.260
Awesome!

16:47.170 --> 16:48.260
Nice!

16:48.950 --> 16:50.950
INCOMING CALL

16:48.950 --> 16:50.950
ERRAND BOY GORIKI RYOGA

16:48.950 --> 16:50.950
DECLINE  ACCEPT

16:51.680 --> 16:52.630
What's this?

17:11.310 --> 17:14.970
Y-Yeah, hey, it's me. Uh, hello?

17:15.270 --> 17:18.980
What took you so long?
Do you have a death wish?

17:20.110 --> 17:22.800
Show your senpai some respect!

17:22.800 --> 17:23.860
<i>Oh, can it.</i>

17:23.860 --> 17:27.240
You guys are gonna run
a little errand for me.

17:30.570 --> 17:33.520
What now? Yes, I failed the—

17:33.520 --> 17:37.200
What? There was another prophecy?
What do you mean?

17:37.690 --> 17:41.460
<i>A Japanese man beat us to it.
We only just found out.</i>

17:41.840 --> 17:45.670
Damn it! Why wouldn't you tell 
me something that important?!

17:45.670 --> 17:48.920
<i>You know what the Future Guide
relic's user is like.</i>

17:49.670 --> 17:50.870
Don't tell me

17:50.870 --> 17:53.100
she couldn't read the kanji again.

17:53.100 --> 17:54.890
<i>Well, you know kids these days.</i>

17:54.890 --> 17:58.350
<i>We're working on it.
You keep doing your best, too.</i>

17:58.350 --> 18:01.560
<i>And be careful of that Japanese guy.</i>

18:02.180 --> 18:03.900
Eh? What for?

18:04.840 --> 18:06.850
<i>The prophecy was rather grim.</i>

18:10.000 --> 18:13.070
<i>He's called "the one who 
will devour the world."</i>

18:13.070 --> 18:15.820
What? Midas?!

18:16.250 --> 18:19.050
<i>Midas is the world's
largest secret auction house,</i>

18:19.050 --> 18:21.570
<i>located in Las Vegas.</i>

18:22.780 --> 18:27.090
<i>If I can get in there, I might be 
able to find out what he's up to.</i>

18:27.370 --> 18:29.900
Go to this month's auction to find

18:29.900 --> 18:34.590
a few items and a man named 
Jack Kayman, also known as "JK."

18:34.900 --> 18:36.590
<i>That's Ogawara's alias.</i>

18:36.970 --> 18:40.380
Don't be ridiculous!
How are we supposed to get there?

18:40.380 --> 18:43.050
<i>Figure that out yourselves.</i>

18:43.050 --> 18:46.500
<i>I'll pay well, 
so expenses won't be an issue.</i>

18:46.500 --> 18:48.110
<i>This is business.</i>

18:50.100 --> 18:52.200
The choice is yours:

18:52.960 --> 18:56.240
go willingly, or get your 
asses beaten to death.

19:01.640 --> 19:03.460
Thank you very much.

19:06.250 --> 19:09.750
Okay. That should cover
the preparations for now.

19:12.350 --> 19:15.760
Time to go relic hunting.

19:14.230 --> 19:15.760
<i>Breaking news.</i>

19:15.760 --> 19:19.110
<i>Another murder has occurred,
marking the fourth this month.</i>

19:19.760 --> 19:25.770
SUICIDE ATTEMPT NEAR KAWASAKI STATION?!

19:20.200 --> 19:25.770
<i>The suspect allegedly attempted
suicide by self-immolation.</i>

19:25.770 --> 19:27.940
<i>According to witnesses...</i>

19:25.770 --> 19:31.210
<i>Just like how it was back then,
before a new tomb appeared.</i>

19:36.250 --> 19:38.700
Hey! Watch where you're going!

19:38.700 --> 19:40.940
I can't get past you!

19:39.100 --> 19:42.870
<i>Oh? That's the guy I beat 
to the Gold/Silver Axe.</i>

19:44.870 --> 19:46.870
<i>If he's here, then...</i>

19:44.870 --> 19:46.870
How about an apology?

19:47.190 --> 19:49.580
<i>the next tomb must be appearing soon.</i>

19:50.040 --> 19:54.090
<i>Around this time, someone 
in Fukuoka had a prophecy relic.</i>

19:53.360 --> 19:54.670
What are you staring at?

19:55.600 --> 19:59.930
<i>And it looks like this guy
also has a relic on him.</i>

19:59.930 --> 20:03.920
<i>That dumbass isn't even hiding its aura.</i>

20:00.920 --> 20:03.920
Hey! You listening to me?!

20:03.920 --> 20:05.680
<i>Whatever it is, I'll take it.</i>

20:03.920 --> 20:05.680
Hey!

20:05.680 --> 20:07.940
Are you ignoring me?!

20:10.040 --> 20:11.360
What the hell?!

20:12.300 --> 20:14.860
Oh, I'm terribly sorry.

20:15.280 --> 20:17.080
It's all over my clothes!

20:17.080 --> 20:21.410
You'd better pay to get them cleaned! 
Do you know how much these cost?!

20:21.410 --> 20:23.870
Gimme a break, man. 
I don't have any money.

20:25.960 --> 20:27.980
It doesn't look expensive to me, anyway.

20:27.980 --> 20:29.270
Excuse me?

20:34.030 --> 20:37.010
You dropped your ID.

20:37.610 --> 20:39.010
G-Give that to me!

20:39.490 --> 20:41.150
<i>Did he recognize me?</i>

20:41.150 --> 20:44.150
<i>No one can know that I'm here.</i>

20:57.720 --> 21:01.510
<i>Bingo! A tomb manifestation.</i>

21:01.510 --> 21:03.490
<i>A new one is appearing right now.</i>

21:03.820 --> 21:06.150
Good. Just like the prophecy.

21:09.500 --> 21:12.300
The manifestation has just begun.

21:12.300 --> 21:14.860
<i>I know. We also received a prophecy saying</i>

21:14.860 --> 21:17.470
<i>the Japanese man with the 
Gold/Silver Axe is near you.</i>

21:18.070 --> 21:20.800
<i>And that you, for some reason,</i>

21:20.800 --> 21:23.720
<i>should be careful around alcohol.</i>

21:25.670 --> 21:26.720
<i>That little shit...</i>

21:27.290 --> 21:29.920
<i>was the guy from the prophecy?</i>
